  "yt_description": "Stop waiting for search engines to find your new page. Tell them with IndexNow.\n\n• Ping a search engine when a URL is added, updated or deleted\n• Step 1: host your key as a .txt file at the site root (key is 8 to 128 characters)\n• Step 2: send one request with the URL and your key\n• One POST can carry up to 10,000 URLs\n• Tell one engine and it is shared with the other participating engines\n• A 200 means accepted; it does not guarantee immediate indexing\n\n#seo #indexnow #technicalseo #indexing #seotips",
  "ig_caption": "Stop waiting for search engines to find your new page. Tell them. 📣\n\n⚡ IndexNow = one ping when a URL is added, updated or deleted\n🔑 Step 1: host your key as a .txt file at your site root\n📨 Step 2: send one request with the URL + key\n📦 Up to 10,000 URLs in one POST\n🔁 Tell one engine, the others get it too\n\nA 200 means accepted, not guaranteed indexing.\n\nFollow @indexfast for more.\n\nVoiceover is AI-generated. Source: indexnow.org.",
